  "procedure": [
    "Single fixed candidate; no fallback, replacement, signing, broadcasting or funding.",
    "Fresh hash-pinned account, balance and allowance reads; allowance must be0 and balance at least amount.",
    "Capture supply at original base state and require a revert.",
    "Execute actual approve via callTracer withLog and prestateTracer; require Approval owner/spender/value plus sender nonce transition and only one USDC storage change.",
    "Build complete poststate overrides from the validated full approve diff using archived buildStateOverrides; preserve nonce and every changed slot, no direct guessed allowance slot or balance patch.",
    "Query allowance under exact approve overrides; validate nonce-only query diff but never carry this measurement-call nonce into the sequence.",
    "Execute unchanged derived supply with exactly the complete approve overrides; retain full trace/diff/events, validate sender nonce after approval to after supply.",
    "Recheck complete pinned header by number; retain every result and stop once candidate succeeds or fails."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Synthetic unsigned calls at historical parent block end, not original-position or signed execution.",
    "Fee fields are omitted; native fees and independent BASEFEE/header-witness validation are outside this discovery.",
    "Provider-supplied execution/state evidence is not an independent engine or cryptographic state proof.",
    "One development fixture, no population coverage/security accuracy claim."
  ]
